### Gotchas learned

- Never edit scripts during Play (domain reload kills coroutines); EditorPrefs `ScriptCompilationDuringPlay=1`
- Play-mode logs: read `Logs/Editor.log` (MCP `read_console` misses them)
- MCP `execute_code` needs `action:"execute"`, `compiler:"codedom"` (C# 6)
- APK build blocks Unity ~20–30 min first time (shader variants); MCP disconnects meanwhile — poll for the APK file
- Open issue: learning scene shows static white speckle noise in Game View under the Android/Mobile URP asset — not yet investigated

